This project consolidates compatible lessons from public Godot agent workflows
into one supervised, portable toolkit. Sources include GodotPrompter, Agent
Sprite Forge, haxqer/godot-skill, fernforestgames/agent-skill-godot, public
Godot specialist skills, Agent Skills, GameDevBench, and GodotIQ. See
SOURCES.md for the exact distinction between attributed bundled material,
independent adaptation, benchmark references, and optional integrations.

No source from repositories without a compatible redistribution license is
included. GodotIQ and other separately licensed services are not redistributed.

